Subject: [PATCH 312/333] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the fast
 session switch patch

Tracing now starts before the first boot request: initBrowserTelemetry returns a promise
that main.tsx awaits, and a failed start warns and resolves instead of leaving an
unhandled rejection. The telemetry test counts loads of the on-demand module.
